name: Fingerprint Pro
category: utilities
tags: anti-fraud, cross-site
website_url: https://fingerprint.com/products/fingerprint-pro/
organization: fingerprint

--- domains
api.fpjs.io
fpjscdn.net
fpnpmcdn.net
fpcdn.io
--- domains

--- filters
||api.fpjs.io^$3p
||fpjscdn.net^$3p
||fpnpmcdn.net^$3p
||fpcdn.io^$3p
||openfpcdn.io/fingerprintjs-pro-gtm/$3p
||openfpcdn.io/gtm-adapter/$3p
--- filters

--- notes
Warning: easy to confuse with the free FingerprintJS, for instance:

/* Fingerprint v3.12.14 - Copyright (c) FingerprintJS, Inc, 2026 (https://fingerprint.com) */
...
var FingerprintJS=...

Looks like FingerprintJS but is Fingerprint v3.12.14 (Pro version).
--- notes
